  "name": "Spell Guard (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>Whenever the necromancer casts a spell with a casting time of 1 standard action, he may instead cast it as a full round action. The necromancer channels some of the energy of the spell into a defensive shield around him, giving him a deflection bonus to his AC equal to the level of the spell being cast. This bonus lasts until the beginning of the necromancer's next turn.</p>",
